    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 440,
        "content": "## Odynza Radar · M2 Content from a Radar strategy plan\nBuilt-in nodes only, no Code nodes, no keys in this file.\n\n1. Open the **Gemini** model node → Credential → *Google Gemini(PaLM) Api* → your Gemini key (same as the Strategy workflow).\n2. Click **Publish** so `/webhook/radar-content` is live.\n3. In Odynza Radar open a ready strategy plan → **Make content**.\n4. Optional: if `N8N_SHARED_TOKEN` is set in Radar's .env, put the same value in **Settings → radar_token**.\n\nAgents: LinkedIn (English) → Instagram (Egyptian Arabic, posts, reels, stories) → Facebook (Egyptian Arabic) → Media Buying (Meta + LinkedIn ads: campaigns, ad sets, ads, A/B tests). Each writes in the voice picked for its platform. Radar checks the drafts, computes every budget, makes the images with FLUX.2 and shows everything for approval. Nothing is published or spent from here."
      },
